                    <p className="text-xs text-gray-400 mb-4">使用特定手势释放元素魔法，双手组合可释放强力连携技。</p>

                    <div className="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-6 text-white/90 text-sm">
                         <div className="flex items-center gap-2">
                            <span className="text-2xl">✋</span> <span className="text-orange-400 font-bold">火</span>
                        </div>
                        <div className="flex items-center gap-2">
                            <span className="text-2xl">👇</span> <span className="text-blue-400 font-bold">水</span>
                        </div>
                        <div className="flex items-center gap-2">
                            <span className="text-2xl">👊</span> <span className="text-purple-400 font-bold">雷</span>
                        </div>
                        <div className="flex items-center gap-2">
