I'm now honing in on the external script integration. Accessing `(window as any).Hands` in `MagicOverlay.tsx` is my current focus. I suspect loading via a script tag, especially with a bundler, might be problematic. I'm checking if the script loads and initializes before the component tries to access it. I'm also looking at the impact of the esm.sh imports.


